<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">EAT WELL / {{date}}</view><view wx:if="{{!meal}}" class="empty">未找到该餐计划</view><block wx:else><view class="row"><view class="title">{{meal.name}}，好好吃饭。</view><text class="tag">{{recorded ? '已记录' : '未记录'}}</text></view><view class="subtitle">调整份量，记录真实发生的一餐。</view><view class="card hero"><view class="muted">{{recorded || dirty ? '当前编辑内容' : '计划食物'}}估算</view><view><text class="big">{{nutrition.kcal}}</text> kcal{{nutrition.unknown ? ' + 未知部分' : ''}}</view><view class="row space"><text>蛋白质 {{nutrition.p}}g</text><text>碳水 {{nutrition.c}}g</text><text>脂肪 {{nutrition.f}}g</text></view><view class="small space">自定义食物未填的营养项不纳入合计。</view></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><view><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted small">{{item.basis}} · {{item.kcal === null ? '能量未知' : '每 100g 约 ' + item.kcal + ' kcal'}}</view></view><button class="link" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="remove">移除</button></view><view class="row space"><input class="grow" type="digit" value="{{item.grams}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="grams"/><text>g</text><button class="secondary" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="replace" wx:if="{{!item.custom}}">替换</button></view><view wx:if="{{item.allergens.length}}" class="caption">已知过敏原：{{item.allergens}}</view></view>
<view class="card"><view>补充实际食物 / 外食</view><input class="space" placeholder="食物名称" value="{{customName}}" data-field="customName" bindinput="input" maxlength="60"/><view class="row space"><input type="digit" placeholder="份量（g）" value="{{customGrams}}" data-field="customGrams" bindinput="input"/><input type="digit" placeholder="每 100g kcal（选填）" value="{{customKcal}}" data-field="customKcal" bindinput="input"/></view><button class="secondary space" bindtap="custom">添加到这餐</button></view><view class="notice">示例食物按水煮、清蒸或直接食用估算，未包含额外油和调味料。外食可自行补充；请自行核对包装与实际过敏原。</view><view class="actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="planned" disabled="{{future}}">按原计划吃了</button><button class="dark" bindtap="save" disabled="{{future}}">保存实际饮食</button></view><button class="secondary space" bindtap="savePlan" wx:if="{{!recorded}}">将当前搭配保存为此餐计划</button><button wx:if="{{recorded}}" class="link space" bindtap="clear">删除这餐记录</button><view class="caption">{{future ? '未来日期仅能调整计划，不能提前记录进食。' : '未记录不等于未进食，记录率不等于饮食达标率。'}}</view></block></view>
